        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Resilia Odorless Aged Garlic Extract takes a more comprehensive approach than a basic garlic supplement. Rather than using ordinary garlic powder, the formula uses aged garlic extract that has undergone an extended maturation process. According to Resilia, this process creates a refined, odorless extract containing standardized <strong>S-allyl cysteine (SAC)</strong>. The formula is primarily positioned around cardiovascular wellness. Aged garlic extract is included to support healthy blood pressure levels, circulation, and arterial function. These are supplement-support claims rather than claims that the product treats cardiovascular disease, and individual results can vary. Resilia also combines its garlic extract with <strong>Coenzyme Q10 in the ubiquinol form</strong>. CoQ10 plays a role in cellular energy production, making it a complementary ingredient for a supplement focused on heart function and daily vitality. <strong>Vitamin K2 as MK-7</strong> rounds out the formula and is included to support normal calcium metabolism. Another practical advantage is the odorless format. Garlic supplements can sometimes leave a lingering taste or noticeable garlic breath, whereas Resilia specifically formulates these softgels to minimize those issues. The package contains <strong>60 softgels</strong>, with two softgels constituting the recommended daily serving and providing a 30-day supply. </p><p></p>",
